TITLE=Yomonsni - Massage - Hot Stone
BGIMAGE=yo-IMG_00024-5D3-raw-shaped-flattened.jpg
SUBHEAD=Hot Stone Massage

      <div class="col-10">
	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Why hot stones?</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Examining the modern history of massage, the addition of hot stones is suprisingly very recent. Use of hot stones has spread widely and one can find a hot stone massage in many locales around the world at this point. Use of heat in a massage is almost intuitive, as the very common practice of using heat pads to soothe sore muscle is widespread. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Using a heated stone as a tool in massage allows this heat to be applied all over your body, wherever it is needed or desired. Adding the heat gives a wonderful addition to the pleasure and the relaxation. The unyielding stones also enable a deeper pressure to penetrate to the base of your muscles. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Stones are heated in a water bath for a couple of hours before use, allowing heat to penetrate deeply into them. Even after the stone has cooled enough to handle, this core heat will radiate forth and will produce a soft warmness for you when left on your body. After a bit, they are returned to the water bath to warm up again.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Stones</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Primarily eschewing commercially prepared stones, naturally sourced stones are used. The variety of shapes and textures is conducive to diversity of sensation, and some of the rougher stones perform a gentle exfoliation.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">No stones or equipment is reused between clients without being subjected to a deep clean.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	
	
	
       
